@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/api

### ========== 로그인 (시드: admin@test.com, customer1@test.com, seller1@test.com / test1234) ==========

### 0-1. ADMIN 로그인
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 0-2. CUSTOMER 로그인
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer1@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

###
@customerId = {{customerLogin.response.body.data.user.id}}
@customerToken = {{customerLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 0-3. SELLER 로그인
# @name sellerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "seller1@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

###
@sellerToken = {{sellerLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ========== 쿠폰 템플릿 ==========

### 1. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 생성 (정액 할인)
# @name createAmountCoupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "신규 가입 환영 5000P 쿠폰",
  "discountType": "AMOUNT",
  "usageValue": 5000,
  "expiresAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 2. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 생성 (정률 할인)
# @name createPercentCoupon
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "여름 맞이 20% 할인 쿠폰",
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "usageValue": 20,
  "expiresAt": "2026-08-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 3. [관리자] 내가 만든 쿠폰 템플릿 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 수정
@templateId = {{createAmountCoupon.response.body.data.id}}

PUT {{baseUrl}}/coupons/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "신규 가입 환영 3000P 쿠폰 (가격 수정)",
  "usageValue": 3000
}

### ========== 쿠폰 지급 & 쿠폰함 ==========

### 5. [관리자] 유저에게 쿠폰 지급 (고객에게 위 템플릿 지급)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupons/give
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{customerId}}",
  "templateId": "{{templateId}}"
}

### 6. [고객] 내 쿠폰함 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons/user/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 7. [관리자] 특정 유저(고객) 쿠폰함 조회 (권한 테스트)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons/user/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ========== 쿠폰 삭제 (핵심 검증) ==========

### 8. [관리자] 쿠폰 템플릿 삭제
# 템플릿이 삭제되어도 유저는 쿠폰 사용 가능해야 함
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coupons/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. [고객] 템플릿 삭제 후 내 쿠폰함 조회 (스냅샷 확인)
# 삭제된 템플릿(templateId가 null 또는 존재하지 않음)이어도 
# couponName, discountPoints 등 스냅샷 정보가 정상 반환되어야 함
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupons/user/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
